Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 01:09:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 22/25] Send the positions of flag and orb carriers

The 5.4.8 client no longer asks for the carriers on the map, and the opcode
the core used for them had no value, so the carriers never showed. Send
the positions to the whole battleground every 5 seconds while a match runs,
with the 5.4.8 layout, and clear the map once when the last carrier is
gone. Temple of Kotmogu reports all four orb carriers, the other
battlegrounds the flag carrier of each team.

Based on Legends of Azeroth 5.4.8.
